  blocks:
  - phase: 1
    anyTimeOfDay: 0
    timeOfDay: 0
    anyDay: 1
    dayNumber: 0
    lines:
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: I heard about your dojo. What an ass.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: "Hey, he\u2019s still my sensei, man."
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: Nah Bro! You won him tournaments. How many new students did he get
        from that? So, what now?
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: "I don\u2019t know. Recover, focus on work, maybe? Name one dojo
        that\u2019d take in a \"Liability\" like me."
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: My sensei would take you in.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: "Your dojo\u2019s more karate and self-help than tournaments. That\u2019s
        not my style."
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: " You can\u2019t give up, Dastaan. You need to learn to fight differently
        now. Like it or not, your injury is part of you. My sensei knows his stuff,
        so join us. I\u2019ve never seen you give up yet, and I won\u2019t let you
        start now."
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 1
      subtitle: Alright, fine. Seems like my only option for now.
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
    - speakerIndex: 0
      subtitle: "That\u2019s my boy! Lemon tea before we head back? My treat!"
      audioClip: {fileID: 0}
      waitForInput: 1
